    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired; no fever or night sweats; weight steady</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Bloating and early fullness; no vomiting; bowels open daily</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Passing urine more often; no bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No leg swelling or calf pain</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Frightened and tearful at times; PHQ-9 7 and GAD-7 8; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

